title: "VNC Remote Secure"
abstract: "Self-hosted remote access for a machine you own —
  desktop, terminal, audio and file share through the browser.
  One Python CLI installs, configures and runs the stack
  (nginx + noVNC + adapters) on Linux and Windows."
